","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dKhOAVnb6GBmVcMil51PAn7DMVU.jpg"},{"id":1612071,"name":"Han Zhi","role":"Song Yang 5 Member 1"},{"id":1072374,"name":"Che Kim-fai","role":"Song Yang 5 Member 3","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hihocDH8UVafHtpb5Cl7VlQf0i.jpg"},{"id":3837060,"name":"Shi Zhanjie","role":"Song Yang 5 Member 4","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3FzZsLUGwb0DnQtatxiajMQCv7M.jpg"},{"id":95695,"name":"Pace Wu Pui-Tsi","role":"Teal Sword","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/spWGPkHh1CSqusaR3jgHEgWVsGc.jpg"},{"id":2035975,"name":"Li Qingxiang","role":"Zhang Hai Duan","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8cLH5vRVzBurvsqo850QVPPBxvU.jpg"},{"id":1353692,"name":"Ma Shuliang","role":"Oil Shop Boss Chen","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nRK6owQ3q5rWH0R4U7JBXZCeXNa.jpg"},{"id":2537439,"name":"Weidong Qin","role":"Butcher","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nuFjo3RQ0HMItbGJO2huWielBTZ.jpg"},{"id":4416332,"name":"Yuan Zhi-Qiang","role":"Purple Sword"},{"id":1129530,"name":"Wang Deshun","role":"Shen Bu","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yTmSmUH3CdEhU1zYd3maDg3ipBZ.jpg"},{"id":1917686,"name":"Li Jun","role":"Old Seven"},{"id":4416352,"name":"Qi Yi-Ming","role":"Demon Grandson"},{"id":3220105,"name":"Tong Lei","role":"Eunuch Cao","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rCZzkUMltO3blfgi4iN30BJHC5a.jpg"},{"id":66053,"name":"Peter Kam Pau-Tat","role":"General Huang","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2Z6qKJWE8V041HtPO2yWmjfO7I3.jpg"},{"id":2663106,"name":"Xing Hanqing","role":"Song Yang 5 Member 2","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hWUxf3a61ASgc1zFjRp04OZBBES.jpg"},{"id":2709822,"name":"Zhang Aiqin","role":"Da Xia","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uOJSnRYZ8Hq5auP7FwKXSTsUQtV.jpg"},{"id":1815921,"name":"Li Yu Fu","role":"Wu Lin Meng","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iOP82GiQAxiVA2m9JN2Z3YWJNYa.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"La congiura della pietra nera","overview":"La setta di assassini della Pietra Oscura cerca incessantemente i resti del principe indiano Bodhi, spazzando via chiunque si frapponga tra loro e la reliquia. Durante una missione la killer Drizzle trova l'ultimo frammento di Bodhi e lo porta via con sé; per sfuggire alla vendetta della setta la killer si sottopone a un intervento estetico che ne muti irreversibilmente i connotati."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Reign of Assassins","overview":"Set in ancient China, Zeng Jing is a skilled assassin who finds herself in possession of a mystical Buddhist monk's remains. She begins a quest to return the remains to its rightful resting place, and thus places herself in mortal danger because a team of assassins is in a deadly pursuit to possess the remains which holds an ancient power-wielding secret."},{"language":"zh-CN","title":"剑雨","overview":"八百年前，天竺人罗摩来至中原弘法，其死后尸体被人盗取并分为两部分。传说拿到罗摩尸体的人能练成绝世武功，因此江湖上风波骤起。时有转轮王（王学圻 饰）操控的黑石杀手集团，专为朝廷杀害谋逆相左之人。转轮王率徒众夜袭藏匿半具达摩尸首的首辅张海端（李庆祥 饰）宅邸，但是他的手下细 雨 （林熙蕾 饰）却带着残尸绝走江湖，致令转轮王发出江湖追杀令，引出一阵血雨腥风。\r 为避追杀，细雨易容，更名曾静（杨紫琼 饰），逃亡期间结识了木讷善良的江阿生（郑雨盛 饰）。一段时间相处，二人渐渐萌生感情，更喜结连理。但是江湖恩怨，因蔓不断，怎可轻易了结……","tagline":"剑雨江湖"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbBriDjbOZVoAYkJxj6d1wGzEIs.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dJXQ840kmEGefoJ0EQGlpZfsoic.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":44092,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbBriDjbOZVoAYkJxj6d1wGzEIs.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qbBriDjbOZVoAYkJxj6d1wGzEIs.jpg","language":"it","width":666,"height":1000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qbBriDjbOZVoAYkJxj6d1wGzE